#: README.md:11
msgid ""
"This tutorial provides a technical guide to implementing **OneOPES** ([JCTC "
"2023](https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/acs.jctc.3c00254)), a replica-"
"exchange strategy developed by Valerio Rizzi, Simone Aureli, Narjes Ansari "
"and Francesco Luigi Gervasio. OneOPES combines enhanced sampling techniques "
"**OPES Explore** ([JCTC "
"2022](https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/acs.jctc.2c00152)) and **OPES "
"MultiThermal** ([PRX "
"2020](https://journals.aps.org/prx/abstract/10.1103/PhysRevX.10.041034)), "
"recently developed by Michele Invernizzi, Pablo Piaggi and Michele "
"Parrinello. The input files from the OneOPES paper are all available on "
"([PLUMED NEST](https://www.plumed-nest.org/eggs/23/011/)) and "
"([Github](https://github.com/valeriorizzi/OneOPES/))."
msgstr ""
"Valerio Rizzi、Simone Aureli、Narjes Ansari、Francesco Luigi Gervasio の Replica"
" Exchange 戦略 **OneOPES**（[JCTC "
"2023](https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/acs.jctc.3c00254)）の実装を説明します。Michele "
"Invernizzi、Pablo Piaggi、Michele Parrinello による **OPES Explore**（[JCTC "
"2022](https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/acs.jctc.2c00152)）と **OPES "
"MultiThermal**（[PRX "
"2020](https://journals.aps.org/prx/abstract/10.1103/PhysRevX.10.041034)）を統合します。原著の全入力は"
" [PLUMED NEST](https://www.plumed-nest.org/eggs/23/011/) と "
"[GitHub](https://github.com/valeriorizzi/OneOPES/) にあります。"

#: README.md:13
msgid ""
"OneOPES is designed to consistently deliver valid free energy results even "
"when the accelerated Collective Variables (CVs) are suboptimal, "
"significantly reducing the human effort usually required for fine-tuning "
"reaction coordinates. The question of whether an enhanced sampling "
"simulation has reached convergence is a crucial one. In fact, convergence is"
" surprisingly hard to define unequivocally. When a reference is available, "
"it is rather straightforward to assess convergence by direclty comparing the"
" estimated free energy and with the reference. However, computational "
"references are often only available in toy model systems that have an "
"analytical solution or that can be simulated for a sufficiently long time. "
"When dealing with open areas of research, such a reference is often "
"unavailable. Establishing criteria to evaluate the quality of an enhanced "
"sampling simulation is a paramount topic that we will discuss in the "
"tutorial."
msgstr ""
"OneOPES は加速する Collective Variables (CVs) "
"が最適でなくても妥当な自由エネルギーを得るよう設計され、Reaction Coordinate "
"調整の手間を減らします。収束の定義は意外に難しい重要な問題です。参照があれば自由エネルギーと直接比較できますが、計算参照は通常、解析解や十分長い MD "
"が可能なモデル系に限られます。未知の研究では参照がないことが多いため、計算の質を評価する基準をここで議論します。"

#: README.md:15
msgid ""
"In OneOPES, we typically have a set of replicas that range in exploratory "
"power. While main replica 0 contains only a single bias on primary CVs, "
"higher replicas explicitly accelerate additional degrees of freedom. "
"Therefore an accelerated exploration of the phase space is achieved in "
"higher replicas. The visited configurations percolate down to replica 0 "
"through replica exchange. Replica 0 thus gains in sampling quality and is "
"used to calculate thermodynamic properties such as the free energy. A more "
"detailed discussion on OneOPES is present in Section 2."
msgstr ""
"探索能力の異なる Replica を使います。Main Replica 0 は主要 CV の Bias だけを持ち、高い Replica "
"は追加自由度を加速します。その Configuration が交換で0へ伝わり、Sampling を改善します。0から自由エネルギーなどの "
"Thermodynamics を計算します。詳細は第2節です。"

#: README.md:17
msgid ""
"**Disclaimer**: OneOPES is not _magic_ and does not encourage the user to be"
" sloppy and not spend time to improve their CVs whenever possible. On the "
"contrary, like any other CV-based enhanced sampling method, the quality of "
"its results improves when the CV quality improves. However, in large, "
"complicated systems such as those found in biophysics, users often reach a "
"point where any improvement to the CV comes at a high cost, i.e. it may be "
"very difficult, time consuming and often system dependent. These complex "
"systems are the true target of the OneOPES strategy. Some of its "
"applications are listed in Section 3 at the end of the tutorial."
msgstr ""
"**注意**：OneOPES は魔法ではなく、可能な CV 改善を省く理由にはなりません。他の CV 型法と同様、CV "
"がよいほど結果も改善します。ただし生物物理などの複雑な大系では、改善が難しく、時間がかかり、系依存になる点に達します。それが主な対象です。応用例は第3節にあります。"

