msgstr "❓🤔 $\\Delta F$ を1.1節と比較してください。実行時間はどれほどで、どちらが効率的ですか？"

#: README.md:253
msgid ""
"1.2.2 **A more robust estimate of the error, run multiple independent "
"simulations:**"
msgstr "1.2.2 **独立実行による頑健な誤差推定**"

#: README.md:255
msgid ""
"Reliably estimating errors from a single simulation poses a certain degree "
"of danger, as the trajectory is biased by the same external potential so it "
"is self-correlated to an extent. Independent trajectories build instead "
"uncorrelated independent external potentials and they represent a stronger "
"convergence test, thus providing a more robust error estimate."
msgstr ""
"単一の Trajectory は同じ外部 Potential で Bias され自己相関するため、誤差推定に注意が必要です。独立実行は無相関な別 "
"Potential を構築し、より強い収束検証・誤差推定になります。"

#: README.md:257
